Reading an Excel data sheet in R
First, install and load the readxl package.
install.packages("readxl")
library(readxl)

# Read Excel file
data <- read_excel("D:/data.xlsx")

# Display data
print(data)


To read a specific sheet:
data <- read_excel("D:/data.xlsx", sheet = "Sheet1")
print(data)
